Running estimate (`running_estimate.csv`, 55 checkpoints, ~10 s apart, 1e5 to 1.76e9 samples): every checkpoint lies within the ±1.96σ_n band around pi (|z| ≤ 1.40, max at an intermediate checkpoint). Checkpoints are cumulative estimates over nested samples, so they are strongly correlated and not independent tests.

